{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ydcna5kn","slideIndex":17,"position":{"left":108.48,"top":417.6,"width":960,"height":96},"name":"bullets 105","text":"발동 : FloorStart · FloorTime · Birth · RatCount · CatAppear · BossFight · UltReady · After · LobbyEnter · PageOpen · CanRankUp · TierAtLeast\n\n조건 : RunMin · RunMax (탈출 시도 횟수) · Unlocked · Locked (기능) · Done · NotDone (단계)\n\n행동 : Ult (해당 쥐 소환 후 필살기 시연) · OpenPage (로비 페이지 이동)","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans KR","color":"#000000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
